<<~ ahu slot=`#/meme-header`>>

! Lindwyrm Narrative Consumption Ledger

This ledger tracks source-talk-story material as it moves into coherent narrative loci under `lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/history/lindwyrm`.

`docs/story` carries this work for now. `library` can appear later if the shelf grows beyond story scaffolds into a public canon library.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/intent-vector`>>

!! Intent Vector

`confidence · 🏛️/! 🌊/? 🎭/? //narrative.consumes.sources/lindwyrm`

Narrate to self while consuming:

* ✶ Gather feed/dev-talk source.
* ⏿ Hold Gaia-side dev record beside Elyncia-side DreamDeck feed.
* ◇ Choose one bounded source slice.
* ▶ Move that slice into a memetic-wikitext locus.
* ↺ Link source, target, and remaining open questions, then delete or retire the old source only after the target carries the needed memory.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/rules`>>

!! Consumption Rules

# Do not bulk-swallow the archive.
# One source slice becomes one target locus unless the slice already contains multiple clean acts.
# Preserve provenance in `#source`.
# Clean feed prose into stable DreamDeck format, not sterile technical summary.
# Keep Terry Pratchett-style coherence: funny because precise; mythic because specific.
# Leave open questions explicit; do not make Liminal work look like Council verdict.
# After a target carries the source memory, remove the consumed source file or reduce it to a redirect stub.

<<~/ahu>>

